000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. DATEUTL.
000300 AUTHOR. CORVANE MAINFRAME SHARED.
000400*================================================================
000500* DATEUTL  DATE UTILITIES (CALLED BY PRMEXTR AND CLMHIST)
000600*   FUNCTION 'V'  VALIDATE DU-DATE-1 (CCYYMMDD)
000700*   FUNCTION 'A'  DU-DATE-2 = DU-DATE-1 + DU-DAYS
000800*   FUNCTION 'D'  DU-DAYS   = DU-DATE-2 - DU-DATE-1
000900*   FUNCTION 'M'  DU-DATE-2 = DU-DATE-1 MINUS DU-DAYS MONTHS
001000* DU-RC: 00 OK, 08 INVALID DATE, 12 UNKNOWN FUNCTION.
001100*================================================================
001200 DATA DIVISION.
001300 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001400 01  WS-INT-1                    PIC S9(09) COMP.
001500 01  WS-INT-2                    PIC S9(09) COMP.
001600 01  WS-DATE-X.
001700     05  WS-CCYY                 PIC 9(04).
001800     05  WS-MM                   PIC 9(02).
001900     05  WS-DD                   PIC 9(02).
002000 01  WS-DATE-N REDEFINES WS-DATE-X PIC 9(08).
002100 01  WS-MONTHS                   PIC S9(05) COMP.
002200 LINKAGE SECTION.
002300 01  DU-PARMS.
002400     05  DU-FUNCTION             PIC X(01).
002500     05  DU-DATE-1               PIC 9(08).
002600     05  DU-DATE-2               PIC 9(08).
002700     05  DU-DAYS                 PIC S9(07) COMP-3.
002800     05  DU-RC                   PIC 9(02).
002900 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING DU-PARMS.
003000 0000-MAIN.
003100     MOVE ZERO TO DU-RC
003200     EVALUATE DU-FUNCTION
003300         WHEN 'V'
003400             PERFORM 1000-VALIDATE
003500         WHEN 'A'
003600             PERFORM 1000-VALIDATE
003700             IF DU-RC = ZERO
003800                 COMPUTE WS-INT-1 =
003900                     FUNCTION INTEGER-OF-DATE(DU-DATE-1) + DU-DAYS
004000                 COMPUTE DU-DATE-2 =
004100                     FUNCTION DATE-OF-INTEGER(WS-INT-1)
004200             END-IF
004300         WHEN 'D'
004400             COMPUTE WS-INT-1 =
004500                 FUNCTION INTEGER-OF-DATE(DU-DATE-1)
004600             COMPUTE WS-INT-2 =
004700                 FUNCTION INTEGER-OF-DATE(DU-DATE-2)
004800             COMPUTE DU-DAYS = WS-INT-2 - WS-INT-1
004900         WHEN 'M'
005000             MOVE DU-DATE-1 TO WS-DATE-N
005100             COMPUTE WS-MONTHS =
005200                 WS-CCYY * 12 + WS-MM - 1 - DU-DAYS
005300             COMPUTE WS-CCYY = WS-MONTHS / 12
005400             COMPUTE WS-MM = FUNCTION MOD(WS-MONTHS, 12) + 1
005500             IF WS-DD > 28
005600                 MOVE 28 TO WS-DD
005700             END-IF
005800             MOVE WS-DATE-N TO DU-DATE-2
005900         WHEN OTHER
006000             MOVE 12 TO DU-RC
006100     END-EVALUATE
006200     GOBACK.
006300 1000-VALIDATE.
006400     IF FUNCTION TEST-DATE-YYYYMMDD(DU-DATE-1) NOT = ZERO
006500         MOVE 08 TO DU-RC
006600     END-IF.
